<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:56:29 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>当 OpenAI 员工遇到问题时，他们会向这个特殊地址发送电子邮件，看看 Sam Altman 是否会立即解决问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/openai-employees-email-friction-address-to-eliminate-bureaucratic-bottlenecks-sam-altman/</link><description>从办公室停车问题到技术障碍，friction@openai.com 收件箱是高级领导层直接了解实际问题并消除“大公司胡言乱语”的一种方式&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2213398981-e1786459368911.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 23:19:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/openai-employees-email-friction-address-to-eliminate-bureaucratic-bottlenecks-sam-altman/</guid></item><item><title>模型停滞、错过最后期限和员工倦怠是如何导致谷歌 DeepMind 崩溃的</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/10/how-stalled-models-missed-deadlines-and-staff-burnout-lead-to-the-unraveling-of-googles-deepmind/</link><description>DeepMind 的现任和前任员工表示，几个月来，紧张局势一直在酝酿。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2273111991_78a0c1.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 09:05:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/10/how-stalled-models-missed-deadlines-and-staff-burnout-lead-to-the-unraveling-of-googles-deepmind/</guid></item><item><title>“囚犯可以在被监禁的同时反对监禁”：Z 世代、资本主义和消费的悖论</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/10/paradox-of-gen-z-capitalism-and-consumption/</link><description>每一代人在年轻时都会尝试反资本主义，但一路上有什么东西被打破了吗？ &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1157943785.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 19:01:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/10/paradox-of-gen-z-capitalism-and-consumption/</guid></item><item><title>一本启发沃伦·巴菲特的书和 14,000 美元的副业如何帮助亿万富翁比尔·阿克曼开始成为一名投资者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/how-a-book-that-inspired-warren-buffett-and-a-14000-side-hustle-helped-billionaire-bill-ackman-get-started-as-an-investor/</link><description>潘兴广场资本管理公司首席执行官比尔·阿克曼表示，他在父亲的房地产公司工作后受到启发，成为一名投资者。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/BillAckman-e1786376698511.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 16:44:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/how-a-book-that-inspired-warren-buffett-and-a-14000-side-hustle-helped-billionaire-bill-ackman-get-started-as-an-investor/</guid></item><item><title>随着婴儿潮一代仅将一小部分财富转移给千禧一代和 X 一代，“财富大转移”将带来巨大的失望</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/great-wealth-transfer-baby-boomers-millennials-gen-x-heir-inheritance/</link><description>对于年轻一代来说，好消息是婴儿潮一代已经将部分资金投入到他们的继承人身上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1372028067-e1786224881243.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 23:01:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/great-wealth-transfer-baby-boomers-millennials-gen-x-heir-inheritance/</guid></item><item><title>继其他欧洲国家的类似规定之后，法国对未经请求的电话推销员每次通话处以 87,000 美元的罚款</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/france-unsolicited-telemarketers-87000-fine-per-call/</link><description>荷兰、德国和其他国家多年来一直采取政策限制未经请求的电话推销员。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2286578517.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 20:24:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/france-unsolicited-telemarketers-87000-fine-per-call/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的媒体和加密货币公司刚刚公布了 2.38 亿美元的季度亏损——这就是这些亏损的来源</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/trump-media-crypto-firm-238-million-quarterly-loss/</link><description>比特币价格的下跌和与合并相关的法律成本损害了业绩，促使人们进军新业务。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289377473-e1786471955812.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 18:16:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/trump-media-crypto-firm-238-million-quarterly-loss/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 8 月 10 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-10-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Price-of-Oil-August-10.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 11:15:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-10-2026/</guid></item><item><title>水母群摧毁了法国 3.2 吉瓦的核电</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/jellyfish-swarms-knock-out-3-2-gigawatts-of-french-nuclear-power/</link><description>由于预计未来几天该国气温将接近 104 华氏度，因此断电。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2228965446-e1786478460752.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 20:06:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/jellyfish-swarms-knock-out-3-2-gigawatts-of-french-nuclear-power/</guid></item><item><title>科勒·卡戴珊 (Khloé Kardashian) 的零食品牌 Khloud 如何领先于蛋白质热潮：“时机就是一切”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/how-khloe-kardashians-snack-brand-khloud-got-ahead-of-the-protein-craze-the-timing-was-everything/</link><description>赫卢德正在塔吉特百货、星巴克和沃尔玛赢得消费者的青睐。对于科勒·卡戴珊 (Khloé Kardashian) 来说，走到这一步的过程是“大量的尝试和错误”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/K_Sophie_Sahara_2-e1786461778481.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 15:25:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/how-khloe-kardashians-snack-brand-khloud-got-ahead-of-the-protein-craze-the-timing-was-everything/</guid></item></channel></rss>